00:53:50,526 --> 00:53:56,526
Slender Man is a 2018 American supernatural horror film directed by Sylvain White
and written by David Birke, based on the character of the same name.

12
00:58:44,210 --> 00:58:50,210
The film stars Joey King, Julia Goldani Telles, Taylor Richardson, Jaz Sinclair,
Annalise Basso, and Alex Fitzalan with Javier Botet as the title character.

13
01:03:37,894 --> 01:03:43,894
Development of the film began in May 2016, with Birke being hired to write
the script and much of the cast signing on a year later.

14
01:08:31,578 --> 01:08:37,578
Filming took place in the state of Massachusetts in June and July 2017.

15
01:13:25,263 --> 01:13:31,263
Released in the United States on August 10, 2018, the film was poorly received by critics and audiences
but was a box office success, grossing $51.7 million against a budget of $10 million.

16
01:18:18,947 --> 01:18:24,947
For her performance, Sinclair was nominated for the Golden
Raspberry Award for Worst Supporting Actress.

17
01:23:12,631 --> 01:23:18,631
The film explores themes of small town, massachusetts,
supernatural, forest, urban legend.

18
01:28:06,315 --> 01:28:12,315
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
